WEBVTT

1
00:00:13.702 --> 00:00:14.403
Ben cried.

2
00:00:14.423 --> 00:00:15.404
"Look out!"

3
00:00:15.424 --> 00:00:20.628
"Huh?" Waldo saw the egg coming and managed to duck in the nick of time.

4
00:00:24.211 --> 00:00:27.514
Ben didn't move, expecting the egg to pass right through him.

5
00:00:30.128 --> 00:00:35.510
But—splat! The dodo egg hit Ben in the chest, and gooey green dodo yolk splattered all over him.

6
00:00:35.530 --> 00:00:38.931
"Ugh." Ben looked down at his shirt.

7
00:00:38.951 --> 00:00:40.351
"What a mess.

8
00:00:40.811 --> 00:00:42.672
Why didn't the egg go right through me?"

9
00:00:43.292 --> 00:00:45.452
Loud laughter suddenly rang out.

10
00:00:48.513 --> 00:00:51.574
A few of the monsters from Team Orange had come into the gym.

11
00:00:51.594 --> 00:00:54.515
"Nice catch, ghost boy!"

12
00:00:54.915 --> 00:00:55.715
Carly called.

13
00:00:56.135 --> 00:00:57.516
Carly was a doppelganger.

14
00:00:58.652 --> 00:01:01.553
A witch named Brunhilda was cackling with delight.

15
00:01:06.876 --> 00:01:08.336
got egg on your face, Ben!"

16
00:01:09.837 --> 00:01:11.177
Winnie hurried over to him.

17
00:01:11.197 --> 00:01:12.458
"Are you all right?"

18
00:01:13.579 --> 00:01:17.720
She held a hand over her mouth, as if she was trying hard not to laugh too.

19
00:01:17.740 --> 00:01:19.581
"I'm fine."

20
00:01:20.161 --> 00:01:21.922
Ben wiped egg off his shirt.

21
00:01:23.643 --> 00:01:25.844
"Sorry about that, Ben," Waldo said.

22
00:01:26.432 --> 00:01:30.573
"I tried to cast a spell to stop the egg, but—" Mog frowned.

23
00:01:30.593 --> 00:01:34.355
"No magic during Field Day events, Waldo.

24
00:01:34.735 --> 00:01:36.755
So you can't use it during practice, either."

25
00:01:37.736 --> 00:01:38.616
Waldo nodded.

26
00:01:38.636 --> 00:01:43.177
"Right!" Zork and his teammates were still laughing.

27
00:01:43.197 --> 00:01:46.638
"No offense, Team Black," Zork said.

28
00:01:46.658 --> 00:01:51.280
"But if that's the best you can do, Team Orange is headed for an easy victory."

29
00:01:53.832 --> 00:01:58.075
"Maybe you guys should just sit in the stands and Carly made her eyes pop out.

30
00:01:58.095 --> 00:02:01.517
"Watch the events instead of competing in them."

31
00:02:02.538 --> 00:02:06.541
Deb, who was the only doppelganger on Mog's team, shot back.

32
00:02:06.561 --> 00:02:09.363
"Well, watch out, Team Orange.

33
00:02:09.903 --> 00:02:12.385
Because tomorrow we're going to bury you!"

34
00:02:12.865 --> 00:02:17.488
She changed into a big tombstone that read RIP Team Orange.

35
00:02:18.889 --> 00:02:22.812
The two doppelgangers kept dueling while everyone in the gym watched.

36
00:02:28.160 --> 00:02:30.282
Carly turned into a giant worm.

37
00:02:30.302 --> 00:02:34.365
"You're the ones who will be sleeping with the worms when we're through with you!"

38
00:02:34.385 --> 00:02:38.328
"Even a worm could outrun you slugs."

39
00:02:39.969 --> 00:02:45.493
Deb became a giant slug and slithered around the gym, leaving a trail of slime.

40
00:02:48.015 --> 00:02:49.556
Serena turned to Winnie.

41
00:02:49.576 --> 00:02:53.439
"This is getting boring," she murmured.

42
00:02:53.459 --> 00:02:54.820
"Let's go."

43
00:02:56.744 --> 00:02:59.745
Heads turned to watch Serena walk toward the exit.

44
00:03:03.247 --> 00:03:04.587
Winnie rushed after her.

45
00:03:06.828 --> 00:03:08.869
Zork stepped into the middle of the gym.

46
00:03:08.889 --> 00:03:12.811
"Huddle up, Team Orange," he called.

47
00:03:12.831 --> 00:03:18.633
"Let's show these Team Black losers how a real team practices."

48
00:03:19.894 --> 00:03:25.056
Carly and Brunhilda joined him, along with Cleo and a werewolf named Lon.

49
00:03:26.912 --> 00:03:28.893
Ben quickly counted the competitors.

50
00:03:32.795 --> 00:03:35.397
only five monsters," he thought.

51
00:03:35.417 --> 00:03:38.418
"I wonder who the sixth member of their team is."

52
00:03:39.399 --> 00:03:40.399
Mog scowled.

53
00:03:40.419 --> 00:03:43.761
"That's enough practice for now, Team Black.

54
00:03:44.141 --> 00:03:45.082
Let's get out of here.

55
00:03:45.482 --> 00:03:48.544
We don't want to give these jokers any tips for winning."

56
00:03:49.204 --> 00:03:50.785
They headed for the exit too.

57
00:03:50.805 --> 00:03:54.227
"Don't drop any more eggs on your way out!"

58
00:03:54.547 --> 00:03:55.728
Carly called after them.

59
00:03:56.736 --> 00:03:57.977
"Yeah," Lon said.

60
00:03:57.997 --> 00:03:59.698
"You guys already stink!"

61
00:04:00.578 --> 00:04:01.499
Zork laughed.

62
00:04:03.000 --> 00:04:09.323
"I'm looking forward to seeing you tomorrow—especially at our first event, the tug-of-war.

63
00:04:10.364 --> 00:04:12.665
That's when you'll get a look at our secret weapon!"

64
00:04:18.328 --> 00:04:20.229
Mog gulped and looked at Ben.

65
00:04:20.249 --> 00:04:23.411
"Did he just say secret weapon?"

66
00:04:33.576 --> 00:04:37.698
The next morning Ben found his teammates on the field behind the school.

67
00:04:38.458 --> 00:04:40.139
They were all dressed in black.

68
00:04:40.159 --> 00:04:44.741
"Welcome to Field Day!"

69
00:04:45.201 --> 00:04:46.282
Mr. Freaky called.

70
00:04:47.522 --> 00:04:52.644
Like the teachers, he was dressed in orange and black so he could root for both teams.

71
00:04:53.665 --> 00:04:55.786
The cheerleaders waved their pom-poms.

72
00:04:55.806 --> 00:04:57.767
"Go, Orange!

73
00:04:58.167 --> 00:04:59.307
Go, Black!"

74
00:04:59.748 --> 00:05:00.368
they cheered.

75
00:05:02.672 --> 00:05:04.413
Mr. Gwarg blew his whistle.

76
00:05:06.474 --> 00:05:09.416
"Okay, monsters, here's how Field Day works.

77
00:05:09.996 --> 00:05:19.601
We've got four events today—the tug-of-war, the sack race, the slime ball toss, and finally, the cross-country race.

78
00:05:21.162 --> 00:05:26.225
The team that wins the most events will be crowned Field Day champions."

79
00:05:27.226 --> 00:05:29.807
"Woo-hoo! That's going to be us!"

80
00:05:30.367 --> 00:05:31.128
Zork shouted.

81
00:05:32.188 --> 00:05:33.068
"Mr. Gwarg?"

82
00:05:33.809 --> 00:05:37.450
Francis hopped up and down, trying to get the gym teacher's attention.

83
00:05:38.211 --> 00:05:40.091
Finally the gym teacher saw him.

84
00:05:40.111 --> 00:05:42.652
"Yes, Francis?"

85
00:05:43.853 --> 00:05:45.573
"What happens if there's a tie?"

86
00:05:45.894 --> 00:05:46.814
Francis asked.

87
00:05:46.834 --> 00:05:49.815
"Huh." Mr.

88
00:05:49.875 --> 00:05:51.996
Gwarg tapped a finger against his chin.

89
00:05:52.016 --> 00:05:54.837
"I never thought about that before."

90
00:05:55.457 --> 00:05:57.398
He was quiet for a few seconds.

91
00:05:59.659 --> 00:06:08.308
"Well, how about this: If there's a tie, the team with the second-place winner in the cross-country race

92
00:06:08.408 --> 00:06:09.268
will win."

93
00:06:09.288 --> 00:06:12.790
A zombie wiped drool from his chin.

94
00:06:12.810 --> 00:06:16.953
"That doesn't make much sense," he said.

95
00:06:17.793 --> 00:06:19.634
He looked around at some other monsters.

96
00:06:19.654 --> 00:06:22.636
"Or does it?"

97
00:06:24.016 --> 00:06:26.238
Another bit of drool dripped from his mouth.

98
00:06:26.258 --> 00:06:28.919
"It doesn't matter if it makes sense!"

99
00:06:29.279 --> 00:06:29.900
Lon said.

100
00:06:30.496 --> 00:06:33.979
"Because Team Orange is going to win every single event!"

101
00:06:37.041 --> 00:06:38.342
He howled loudly.

102
00:06:39.342 --> 00:06:40.583
Deb narrowed her eyes.

103
00:06:40.603 --> 00:06:42.985
"No way, hairball!"

104
00:06:44.106 --> 00:06:46.227
Monsters booed and cheered again.

105
00:06:54.733 --> 00:06:58.636
They were so loud that some monsters held their hands over their ears.

106
00:06:59.472 --> 00:07:04.159
A monster with four ears but only two hands tried desperately to cover her ears.

107
00:07:05.822 --> 00:07:06.583
Ben sighed.

108
00:07:08.265 --> 00:07:12.372
Field Day hadn't even started yet, and he already felt exhausted.
